{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "c0ffee01-1111-4a2b-9c3d-coffeenchill01",
    "name": "CoffeeNChill - Part 1 (Tables & Blobs)",
    "description": "CLDV6212 Part 1 test suite for the CoffeeNChill Azure Functions app.\n\nCovers the MenuItems Table Storage CRUD surface and the staff-docs Azure Blob Storage endpoints, including negative-path tests (400 / 404 / 409).\n\nPer the POE addendum (Sept 2026), staff documents are stored in Azure Blob Storage rather than an Azure File Share, because Azurite does not emulate the Files service. Blob IS emulated, so the entire suite runs against the local Azurite container with no live Azure account.\n\nSetup:\n1. Import this collection.\n2. Import CoffeeNChill.postman_environment.json and select it.\n3. Ensure baseUrl points at your running host (http://localhost:7071/api).\n4. Run the whole collection top to bottom - requests are ordered so state flows correctly.\n\nThe Documents > Upload request needs a file selected manually in the form-data body (Postman cannot persist binary file paths in an export).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "testCategory",
      "value": "Hot Drinks"
    },
    {
      "key": "testSku",
      "value": "COF-001"
    },
    {
      "key": "uploadedFileName",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Fail fast with a readable message if the environment is not selected.",
          "if (!pm.environment.get('baseUrl') && !pm.collectionVariables.get('baseUrl')) {",
          "    throw new Error('baseUrl is not set. Select the CoffeeNChill environment before running.');",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Applied to every request in the collection.",
          "pm.test('Response time is under 3000ms', function () {",
          "    pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(3000);",
          "});"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Menu - Table Storage",
      "description": "CRUD operations against the MenuItems Azure Table.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Menu Item (201)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 201 Created', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Response echoes the created item', function () {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(body.sku).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('testSku'));",
                  "    pm.expect(body.category).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('testCategory'));",
                  "    pm.expect(body.name).to.eql('Espresso');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Price is returned as a number', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().price).to.be.a('number');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Content-Type is JSON', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Content-Type')).to.include('application/json');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"category\": \"Hot Drinks\",\n  \"sku\": \"COF-001\",\n  \"name\": \"Espresso\",\n  \"description\": \"Double shot of locally roasted single-origin beans\",\n  \"price\": 28.50,\n  \"isAvailable\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/menu",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "menu"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Inserts a new entity into the MenuItems table. PartitionKey = category, RowKey = sku."
          }
        },
